---
import Base from '../../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="Thank you">
  <p class="eyebrow">Report received</p>
  <h1>Thank you.</h1>
  <p class="lede">Your report is in. There is no receipt, no reference number, and no way to look it up — that is the point.</p>
  <p>It will be counted in the next release, and it will appear only inside grouped statistics under the rules in the <a href="/docs/release-spec">release specification</a>. Nothing on this page identifies your submission, and nothing was stored until you pressed confirm.</p>
  <div class="notice">
    <p>If you want to help further: the most useful thing you can do is tell someone else who uses these compounds that this exists. We do not run ads and do not promote ourselves in communities.</p>
  </div>
  <p><a href="/data">See what is published so far</a> · <a href="/contribute">Report another compound</a></p>
</Base>
